# CMake / C build verify

This project uses CMake + elomaxz-style C. After editing `CMakeLists.txt`, `app.c`, or headers:

1. Configure/build with the project's documented command (e.g. `cmake --build build`).
2. Fix compile errors before summarizing — ColumnLimit and function signatures often need read-before-patch.
3. Do not claim MVU/refactor steps are complete without a successful build.

For layout issues (e.g. ColumnLimit wrapping parameters), read the surrounding function in `app.c` before applying StrReplace.
